    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "An Exclusive Collection of Exceptional New Detached Homes\r\n\r\nDiscover a limited release of beautifully designed A-rated detached homes in the highly sought-after Árd Coillte development, perfectly positioned along the scenic banks of the River Shannon in Ballina, Co. Tipperary.\r\n\r\nBrock DeLappe Estate Agents are delighted to present just nine outstanding new-build homes, offering a choice of four thoughtfully designed house types. Built to the highest standards, each home combines contemporary architecture with exceptional craftsmanship, creating stylish and energy-efficient living spaces ideal for modern family life.\r\n\r\nThese superb homes feature elegant, fully integrated kitchens, four generously proportioned bedrooms with bespoke fitted wardrobes, luxurious fully tiled bathrooms, spacious private rear gardens, and convenient off-street parking to the front.\r\n\r\nNestled in the charming riverside village of Ballina, with the historic town of Killaloe just moments away across the River Shannon, residents can enjoy an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, pubs, shops, and local amenities. The M7 provide easy access to Limerick, while Dublin is less than a two-hour drive away.\r\n\r\nThis is a rare opportunity to secure a premium new home in one of the region's most desirable locations.\r\n\r\nRegister your interest to view our amazing show home today"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Newly built detached A-rated homes\r\nArchitecturally designed with premium finishes throughout\r\nFour different house types\r\nMature sought after estate\r\nHigh-spec bespoke fitted kitchen with integrated appliances\r\nFour spacious bedrooms\r\nSeparate utility/boot room\r\nBespoke fitted wardrobes throughout\r\nStylish contemporary bathrooms & ensuites with premium sanitary ware\r\nSpacious gardens"
      },
      {
